{"path":"io/basic_ostream/~basic_ostream","title":"std::basic_ostream<CharT,Traits>::~basic_ostream","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_ostream&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>~basic_ostream","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream/~basic_ostream","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Destroys the basic_ostream object.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">virtual</span> ~basic_ostream<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Destroys the <code>basic_ostream</code> object. This destructor does not perform any operation on the underlying streambuffer (<code>rdbuf()</code>): the destructors of the derived output streams such as <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ofstream\">std::basic_ofstream</a></span> and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostringstream\">std::basic_ostringstream</a></span> are responsible for calling the destructors of the stream buffers.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;sstream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> add_words<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf\"><span class=\"kw1741\">std::<span class=\"me2\">streambuf</span></span></a><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> p<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1746\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostream</span></span></a> buf<span class=\"br0\">(</span>p<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// buf shares the buffer with s</span>\n    buf <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" is the answer\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span> <span class=\"co1\">// calls the destructor of buf. p remains unaffected</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostringstream\"><span class=\"kw1753\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostringstream</span></span></a> s<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">42</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    add_words<span class=\"br0\">(</span>s.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\".\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>42 is the answer.</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_ostream","title":"std::basic_ostream"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_ostream<CharT,Traits>::~basic_ostream","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Destroys the basic_ostream object."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":97,"codeBlockCount":2}
